# fifo_child_page_list_empty: A page list whose first entry is 0 maps nothing: the ring's mapping (Fifo::map_ring) fails, so the FIFO never starts (running stays 0) and a woken command never runs; yet the define signals, because DeviceCore::create_fifo ignores Fifo::start's result. Deleting it works.
